      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/valley-mills-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Although the Texas Eagle Amtrak line passes nearby, Valley Mills has no train station; the closest stop is McGregor.",
